  "mmd": "%% Figure 13-1 — Context Manifest Assembly\n%% Retail records A and B pass source and consumer checks and enter context. The incorrectly tagged insurance result fails the source check and follows a quarantine path that cannot deliver its payload to the agent.\nflowchart LR\n A[\"Retail product registry\"] -->|indexes A| I[\"Retrieval index\"]\n B[\"Retail CRM\"] -->|indexes B| I\n X[\"Insurance policy repository\"] -->|indexes item| I\n I -->|returns hits| S[\"Context retrieval service\"]\n S -->|checks sources| C[\"Source ACL recheck\"]\n C -->|admits A/B| M[\"Context assembler\"]\n C -.->|rejects insurance| Q[\"Restricted quarantine\"]\n M -->|records decisions| R[(\"Context Manifest\")]\n Q -.->|records denial| R\n M -->|delivers A/B| U[\"Context consumer\"]\n",
  "alt": "Retail records A and B pass source and consumer checks and enter context. The incorrectly tagged insurance result fails the source check and follows a quarantine path that cannot deliver its payload to the agent."
